# Tailscale relay doors: "listen-on-the-Kobo  server-on-the-tailnet", one per line.
# Programs on the Kobo (the browser, Kobo sync) use http://127.0.0.1:PORT and
# the relay carries it over Tailscale. Changes apply when Tailscale restarts
# (Tailscale page: Turn off, Turn on). Copy to .adds/tailscale/relay.conf.

# for example Calibre-Web (Kobo sync) published with Tailscale Serve; in
# .kobo/Kobo/Kobo eReader.conf, [OneStoreServices]:
#   api_endpoint=http://127.0.0.1:8083/kobo/TOKEN
#127.0.0.1:8083  https://myserver.tailnet-name.ts.net:8446

# and calibre's own content server (NickelMenu > Calibre opens /mobile)
#127.0.0.1:8084  https://myserver.tailnet-name.ts.net:8445
